# Plain config goes in the Dockhold dashboard; secrets (API keys, tokens) go in
# the Vault — encrypted and injected at runtime. Read them with os.environ.
#
# PORT is provided by Dockhold at runtime and expanded by the Dockerfile CMD —
# don't set it yourself.
#
# Example:
# SOME_API_KEY=...        # put real secrets in the Vault, not here
#
# If you enable the managed database add-on, Dockhold injects DATABASE_URL.
